        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dowiedzmy się, jak możemy policzyć elementy w tablicach i wykorzystać te informacje w sprytny sposób w grze.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147933,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Używamy słowa <code>length</code> po nazwie tablicy i kropce <code>.</code>, aby uzyskać liczbę elementów w tablicy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147934,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wypróbuj to samodzielnie: zacznij od nazwy tablicy, dodaj kropkę <code>.</code>, a następnie <code>length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>enemies</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>console.log()</code> wokół <code>enemies.length</code>, aby wyświetlić w konsoli długość tablicy <code>enemies</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>console.log</code>, następnie <code>(</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147936,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy również przechowywać długość tablicy w zmiennej.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = enemies.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147937,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz zmienną <code>length</code> i zapisz w niej długość tablicy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = enemies.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>length</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>enemies.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147938,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Niezależnie od tego, ile elementów znajduje się w tablicy, <code>length</code> policzy je za nas.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;skeleton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147939,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wypróbuj samodzielnie: policz elementy w tablicy <code>enemies</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"howMany\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;skeleton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>enemies</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nawet jeśli tablica <code>enemies</code> jest pusta, <code>enemies.length</code> podaje liczbę znajdujących się w niej elementów.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147941,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przechowaj pustą tablicę w <code>enemies</code>, aby zobaczyć, że jej długość wynosi <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, a następnie <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy użyć długości tablicy do tworzenia <strong>instrukcji warunkowych</strong> zależnych od liczby jej elementów.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147943,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Spróbuj: wyświetl wiadomość tylko wtedy, gdy <code>enemies.length</code> jest większe niż <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>enemies.length</code>, następnie <code>&gt;</code> i na końcu <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy także użyć długości tablicy, aby utworzyć <strong>pętle for</strong>, które przechodzą przez wszystkie jej elementy.</p><p>W tym celu powtarzamy pętlę tyle razy, ile elementów znajduje się w tablicy, używając właściwości <code>length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Powtórz pętlę for dwa razy, określając, że wartość <code>i</code> musi być mniejsza niż <code>length</code> tablicy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i &lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147946,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wykonaj pętlę for trzy razy, określając, że <code>i</code> musi być mniejsze niż <code>inventory.length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>inventory.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienna licznika <code>i</code> przechowuje wartości <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code> podczas kolejnych powtórzeń pętli. Jednak <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code> to również <strong>indeksy</strong> elementów w <code>inventory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zatem za każdym powtórzeniem pętli <code>i</code> przechowuje <strong>indeks</strong> elementu w tablicy <code>inventory</code>. Możemy użyć tego indeksu, aby uzyskać dostęp do elementu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przetestuj pętlę: użyj zmiennej licznika <code>i</code> jako indeksu, aby wyświetlić wszystkie elementy w <code>inventory</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>inventory</code>, następnie <code>[</code>, a potem <code>i</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
